#ASSERT `May I increase the bond as I propose` `as the lessor` TRUE `Chloe's bond to 2000, payable 15 August 2028` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `May I increase the bond as I propose` `as the lessor` TRUE `Jake's bond to 2030 after a cat is approved` EQUALS yes
