#ASSERT `How many days notice must I give the tenant on this ground` `as the lessor` `my fixed term is ending` EQUALS `at least` 30
#ASSERT `How many days notice must I give the tenant on this ground` `as the lessor` `I breached a term other than paying rent, and have not remedied it` EQUALS `at least` 7
#ASSERT `What does my notice of termination do` `as the lessor` TRUE `no ground` `a notice given 1 June 2029 for 31 July 2029` `Chloe's periodic tenancy in 2029` EQUALS `your notice is valid: if the tenant has not left by the day it names, you must apply to a court`
#ASSERT `What does my notice of termination do` `as the lessor` TRUE `no ground` `a notice given 1 June 2029 for 30 July 2029` `Chloe's periodic tenancy in 2029` EQUALS `your notice is ineffectual: too little notice`
#ASSERT `What does my notice of termination do` `as the lessor` TRUE `no ground` `a notice given 1 June 2029 for 31 July 2029` `Chloe's fixed term to 31 August 2028` EQUALS `your notice is ineffectual: this ground cannot end the fixed term during its currency`
#ASSERT `What does my notice of termination do` `as the lessor` TRUE `my fixed term is ending` `a notice given 1 August 2028 for 30 August 2028` `Chloe's fixed term to 31 August 2028` EQUALS `your notice is ineffectual: the possession day is earlier than the expiry day`
#ASSERT `What does my notice of termination do` `as the lessor` TRUE `I breached a term other than paying rent, and have not remedied it` `a notice given 15 May 2029 for 22 May 2029, after a notice to remedy on 5 May` `Chloe's periodic tenancy in 2029` EQUALS `your notice is ineffectual: no notice to remedy was given at least 14 days before`
#ASSERT `What does my notice of termination do` `as the lessor` TRUE `I have not paid rent` `a notice given 15 May 2029 for 22 May 2029, with no notice to remedy` `Chloe's periodic tenancy in 2029` EQUALS `your notice is valid as an immediate rent notice: if the tenant pays all rent owing before the day it names, you may not apply to a court`
#ASSERT `What does my notice of termination do` `as the lessor` TRUE `no ground` `a notice given 1 June 2029 for 31 July 2029` `a periodic tenancy with an excessive-rent application pending` EQUALS `your notice is ineffectual: excessive-rent proceedings or an order (section 65)`
#ASSERT `What does my notice of termination do` `as the lessor` TRUE `no ground` `an unsigned notice given 1 June 2029 for 31 July 2029` `Chloe's periodic tenancy in 2029` EQUALS `your notice is ineffectual: not in the form section 61 requires`
#ASSERT `What does my notice of termination do` `as the lessor` TRUE `my fixed term is ending` `a notice given 1 August 2028 for 31 August 2028` `Chloe's periodic tenancy in 2029` EQUALS `your notice is ineffectual: there is no fixed term to end`
