#ASSERT `What happens to the tenancy I grant when the fixed term expires` `as the lessor` TRUE TRUE (Date 31 8 2028) (Date 31 8 2028) EQUALS `the answer is` `the term ends on the expiry day`
#ASSERT `If the tenant and I both give notice ending the fixed term, which possession day counts` `as the lessor` TRUE (Date 31 8 2028) (Date 30 9 2028) EQUALS `on` (Date 31 8 2028)
